# Kovegas customer UI

Premium local tour operator (Las Vegas Mania Tour). Feel: Apple / Airbnb Experiences / GetYourGuide. Not a SaaS dashboard, coupon site, or casino neon page.

**Scope:** public customer pages only. Do not add marketing CTAs, sticky Book Now bars, or hero CRO to admin, guide, or internal tools.

**Do not change:** booking, payment, availability, cancellation, APIs, or Supabase queries. Improve layout, copy visibility, and usability only.

## Visual

- Tokens only: `--background` `--foreground` `--card` `--muted` `--primary` `--secondary` `--accent` `--border` `--input` `--ring` `--success` `--warning` `--danger`
- Navy/near-black, warm sand, sunset/coral booking accent, white/gray. Green only for confirmation/availability
- next/font. One sans (Inter/Geist/Manrope/Plus Jakarta). Max 3 weights. Avoid unnecessary uppercase
- Display `text-4xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-semibold tracking-tight`. Page `text-3xl md:text-5xl`. Section `text-2xl md:text-4xl`. Body `text-base md:text-lg leading-7 text-muted-foreground`
- Container: `max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8`. Sections `py-16 md:py-24`. Compact `py-10 md:py-16`
- Alternate white / muted / photography / dark highlight. Do not wrap every section in a card
- Radius: buttons/inputs `rounded-lg` or `rounded-xl`; cards `rounded-xl`; feature images `rounded-2xl`. Pills only for filters/tags
- Cards: `border border-border/60 shadow-sm`. Interactive: `hover:shadow-lg duration-300`. No heavy shadows
- Primary CTA: shared Button, high contrast, `h-11` desktop / `h-12` mobile booking. Max 2 primary buttons per viewport
- next/image, real photography, alt text. Hero 16:9, cards 4:3. Overlay `from-black/70 via-black/20 to-transparent`. No long text on images
- lucide-react only. 16px meta, 18–20px controls, 24px features. No emoji icons
- Motion: 200–300ms ease-out fade/hover/accordion only. Respect prefers-reduced-motion

## CRO (customer pages)

- Clear booking CTA above the fold. Repeat after highlights, itinerary, reviews, FAQ
- Mobile sticky bottom bar: price + Book Now / Check Availability
- Price near CTA: `From $199 / person`. Show inclusions. Do not hide fees
- 3–5 trust items near CTA (Free Cancellation, Hotel Pickup, Small Group, Licensed Operator)
- Honest urgency only when data supports it
- Reviews before FAQ. Rating near hero CTA
- 3–6 short highlight cards early
- Desktop sticky booking panel: price, date, guests, CTA, trust, cancellation, contact (ghost, not competing)
- Short benefit-first copy. No fake scarcity

## Components

Search existing components before creating new ones. Reuse or extend variants. Keep files under 200 lines when practical.

Prefer: Container, Section, SectionHeader, Button, TourCard, TourGrid, PriceDisplay, ReviewSummary, TrustBadge, FeatureList, PickupInfo, IncludedList, ItineraryTimeline, TourGallery, BookingCard, StickyBookingBar, FAQSection, RelatedTours, EmptyState, LoadingSkeleton

Tour card: image, badge, title, rating, duration, location, price, Book Now. Whole card clickable.

Included: check / minus icon lists. Itinerary: timeline. FAQ: accordion, one panel open by default.

Mobile-first. Tap targets ≥ 44px. No horizontal scroll. Tables → cards on mobile.

## Quality

Hover, focus, loading, empty, error states. Semantic HTML, visible labels, keyboard access, visible focus. Do not communicate status by color alone.

Before finishing UI: premium and consistent, booking action obvious, price clear, mobile intentional, logic unchanged. Verify the changed customer flow in the browser when browser tools are available.
